ion></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>深度了解空间科学学科布局、研究方向与核心领域，直观感受我国空间科学发展与未来规划。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>b</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>与顶尖科研团队面对面交流</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>倾听空间中心科研团队、导师专题分享，与优秀导师、研究生代表面对面座谈，答疑解惑、规划学术与职业方向。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>c</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>沉浸式体验科研氛围</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>参观空间中心园区，科研、教学、实验平台，亲身感受前沿科研环境、大科学工程实践场景与浓厚学术氛围，提前体验研究生学习生活。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>d</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>优先获得深造机会</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>优秀营员将在推免生选拔中获得重点关注，助力未来研究生阶段发展。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>e</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>全方位资助与奖励</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营期间食宿全免，不收取任何费用，并报销来程路费（动车/高铁二等座标准）。直博生入学后将获得专项奖学金，在读期间享受更具竞争力的助研津贴。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>活动于7月中上旬举办，共2批，每批拟招收营员80-100人，预计3天，最终入营人数将根据报名情况及遴选结果动态调整。入选营员须按时并全程参加夏令营各项活动，遵守相关规章制度。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>开启空间科学探索之旅</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请时间：</span></strong><span><span>2026年5月-6月25日（</span><span>具体安排请关注空间中心研究生教育网页</span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>申请条件：</span></strong></span><span><span>全国高校本科三年级（2027年毕业）优秀学生，学业成绩优异，专业背景相符，对空间科学有浓厚兴趣和科研潜质。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>对口专业</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>：</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>·理科</span></strong></span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NUOp9iaBUCzcDIJ2YlicWyCMWs7zEiawJ9CmN5HZbsep5icml2XRmHnxAujzdvKqujQfYqlIyHDn5E8elu7esz4AgsWPcLVoFvsQibkkl2JypXX0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>·工科</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/NUOp9iaBUCzdQp8Y5UmWBOIW2b9aqAOEZxqWZ7Unc146uDwtWaj7UMicIX1XSUBuCibckXkdonrRtJjMxcBnP9iamgwI3wawC3dpr8cW8f7DMDs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>请密切关注中国科学院大学“科教结合协同育人行动计划”网站（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn）及空间中心研究生教育网页（http://www.nssc.ac.cn/yjsb）发布的正式通知，按指引完成报名。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section>